NFS

A Plug-In for Mill. Put it in the "Mill Plug-Ins" folder.

  nfs://host/                The server's exports
  nfs://host/export/path     Network File System version 3, over TCP

Folders are pages; files come as they are. Read-only. Each request carries
the User ID and Group ID from Settings; the server must allow ports above
1023 ("insecure"). Without a portmapper, NFS is on 2049 and MOUNT on the
Mount port setting.

plugin://nfs/about has a form, filled in from Settings.

Written from the published specifications (RFC 1813, 1831, 1832, 1833,
and 2224).

Build: ./build.sh writes build/NFS.bin.
